## 📝 Customization Tips

### Change Colors
Edit `tailwind.config.js`:
```javascript
colors: {
  brand: {
    red: '#YOUR_COLOR',
    white: '#FFFFFF',
  }
}
```

### Add More Products
Edit `pages/index.js` and add more `<ProductCard>` components.

### Add Real Customer Logos
Replace the text in `components/CustomerBanner.js` with actual logo images:
```javascript
<img src="/images/customer-logo.png" alt="Customer" />
```

### Connect Contact Form
To make the form send emails, you can:
1. Use Formspree.io
2. Use EmailJS
3. Add a backend API

